msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/data-encoding/extracted-outputs/ba0886eb-1c56-4b15-a731-d94d805254e1-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We can visualize the rotation in $\\phi$ using the plot_Nstates function we defined.\n"
